{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":38,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":38,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b050700beecf50d38480ed5","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s a sharp question, and it’s one she can actually answer—it’s about her paperwork, not your character. “When a patient tells you they don’t know if they’ll do it, how does that get written down?” That’s not asking for reassurance. It’s asking for the rule.\n\nAnd it’s askable before the two weeks, folded paper or not. It doesn’t require you to have opened it.\n\nDo you think she’d answer it straight, or would she hear it as you pre-negotiating a no?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s a sharp question, and it’s one she can actually answer—it’s about her paperwork, not your character. “When a patient tells you they don’t know if they’ll do it, how does that get written down?” That’s not asking for reassurance. It’s asking for the rule.\n\nAnd it’s askable before the two weeks, folded paper or not. It doesn’t require you to have opened it.\n\nDo you think she’d answer it straight, or would she hear it as you pre-negotiating a no?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3301,"promptTokens":1681,"completionTokens":232,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"82e47bdbc0a540c0accdd71b03ce8302","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.398204545338639E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b050700beecf50d38480ed4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491584567,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b050700beecf50d38480ed4","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"I'd have to ask her what she does with a not knowing. Not whether it's fine, I don't need that. I need to know if it goes in the record as a no","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"82e47bdbc0a540c0accdd71b03ce8302","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.398204545338639E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b050700beecf50d38480ed5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491584564,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0506fabeecf50d38480ed0","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"So the pocket isn’t hiding a verdict. It’s hiding a sentence you already know: *I don’t know if I’ll do it.* And the problem is she has no slot for that sentence. It lands as a no or as a yes that curdles into a no-show. Either way it becomes something she can hold against the ledger.\n\n“I don’t know” is the most accurate thing you could tell her, and it’s the one answer that has nowhere to go in that room.\n\nWhat would she have to be able to hear for that sentence to be sayable—does she need to say out loud that not knowing isn’t a no, or is that something you’d have to ask her for?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"So the pocket isn’t hiding a verdict. It’s hiding a sentence you already know: *I don’t know if I’ll do it.* And the problem is she has no slot for that sentence. It lands as a no or as a yes that curdles into a no-show. Either way it becomes something she can hold against the ledger.\n\n“I don’t know” is the most accurate thing you could tell her, and it’s the one answer that has nowhere to go in that room.\n\nWhat would she have to be able to hear for that sentence to be sayable—does she need to say out loud that not knowing isn’t a no, or is that something you’d have to ask her for?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4719,"promptTokens":1723,"completionTokens":309,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:38"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":37,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"9c78d908e85b454fb7f21210bdd05781","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708182074614437,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b0506fabeecf50d38480ecf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491578365,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0506fabeecf50d38480ecf","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"That I don't know if I'll do it. And she'll hear that as a no, or as me agreeing and then not showing up, and both of those are worse than the folded paper","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":36,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708182074614437,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b0506fabeecf50d38480ed0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491578362,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0506efbeecf50d38480ec7","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Then it’s not the referral you’re avoiding—it’s the conversion. Open it, and every night becomes a unit: did it or didn’t. Same ledger as the notebook, just with a new column. And she’s going to ask, which means someone else is holding the ledger with you.\n\nFolded, you’re not doing the program either—but nobody’s asking yet. That’s what the pocket buys: a delay on being asked.\n\nWhen she asks, what’s the answer you’re afraid you’ll have to give her?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Then it’s not the referral you’re avoiding—it’s the conversion. Open it, and every night becomes a unit: did it or didn’t. Same ledger as the notebook, just with a new column. And she’s going to ask, which means someone else is holding the ledger with you.\n\nFolded, you’re not doing the program either—but nobody’s asking yet. That’s what the pocket buys: a delay on being asked.\n\nWhen she asks, what’s the answer you’re afraid you’ll have to give her?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3767,"promptTokens":1700,"completionTokens":304,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":35,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"eaaad51ad7e64fca94f61a043e51b575","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":7.484539176582732E-5,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b0506efbeecf50d38480ec6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491567616,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0506efbeecf50d38480ec6","chatId":"dff9eb5875694e5fb90bd441c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"The homework. The wording is nothing. If I open it and it says come to this program on this night, then every night from then on I'm either doing it or not doing it, and she's going to ask","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":34,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"eaaad51ad7e64fca94f61a043e51b575","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":7.484539176582732E-5,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"surpri