1c55ab7de","sessionId":null,"userId":130800,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Folded, it’s just an object with no verdict in it. Open, it becomes a task—and tasks can be failed. So the pocket is the last place it gets to be neutral.\n\nBut it’s already doing work on you folded. It’s why 2 a.m. has a shape, why the two weeks has a countdown. The paper is quiet, not neutral.\n\nWhat would make opening it feel less like handing yourself a pass/fail slip? Reading it somewhere that isn’t this table, or reading only the first line and stopping?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Folded, it’s just an object with no verdict in it. Open, it becomes a task—and tasks can be failed. So the pocket is the last place it gets to be neutral.\n\nBut it’s already doing work on you folded. It’s why 2 a.m. has a shape, why the two weeks has a countdown. The paper is quiet, not neutral.\n\nWhat would make opening it feel less like handing yourself a pass/fail slip? Reading it somewhere that isn’t this table, or reading only the first line and stopping?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2567,"promptTokens":1689,"completionTokens":164,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":31,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"16d4273f7cad426d9a3e95f91492f7f1","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":7.096596247756551E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b0506e3beecf50d38480eb9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795491555868,"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:39:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0506e3beecf50d38480eb9